# Purpose: Select invoice ID, vendor, and amount columns for review from an explicitly unquoted comma-separated export.
# Inputs: finance/invoices.csv: unquoted CSV; fields contain no embedded commas or quotes.
# Outputs: reports/invoice-audit.csv: invoice ID, vendor, and amount columns; stdout echoes the extract.
accept invoices_path as text with default "finance/invoices.csv"
run mkdir with flags ["-p"] and paths ["reports"]
run cat with path invoices_path
pipe to cut with delimiter "," and fields "1,2,4"
then save to "reports/invoice-audit.csv"
